node_modules
.DS_Store
dist
dist-ssr
*.local
# RESEND_API_KEY lives in one of these and is never committed. `.env` alone
# covers the file people mean to write and not the three they actually write,
# so the glob is here too, with an escape for a checked-in example that holds
# names and no values.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
# direnv. Not covered by the globs above, and it is the other file people
# actually put `export RESEND_API_KEY=` in.
.envrc
.nitro
.tanstack
.wrangler
.output
# The vercel preset's build directory. `.vercel/` also holds the project link
# `vercel` writes on first deploy, which carries the project and org ids; both
# halves stay out of the repository.
.vercel

# Generated share images. A pure function of the case study frontmatter,
# public/fonts/archivo.woff2 and scripts/og.mjs, all of which are committed.
# Checking the PNGs in would be caching a derived artefact that no reviewer can
# read: a binary diff cannot show that a card still names last week's title.
# `bun run build` regenerates them before vite copies public/.
public/og
.vinxi
__unconfig*
todos.json

# test artefacts
test-results
playwright-report
blob-report
.playwright
